hidden=\"true\" class=\"tc-repop-msg\"></div></div><div class=\"divider\"><hr></div><div class=\"prefPanel gdprAccessiblePrefPanel\"><div class=\"categoryPanelAccessible\"><div class=\"catDivContainer\"><div class=\"categoryDivContent\"><div class=\"gwt-HTML accessibleCategoryHeadingName\"><h2 translate=\"no\">Strictly necessary</h2></div><div class=\"gwt-HTML\"><p>Strictly necessary cookies are used to enable the basic functions of this website like security. As these cookies are essential, they cannot be switched off.</p></div></div><div class=\"required-active\"><div class=\"gwt-HTML\"><p>Active</p></div></div></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"View\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"accordion\"><div class=\"gwt-HTML\" translate=\"no\">See more detailed preferences</div></button><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"accordionContentContainer\"><div class=\"prefPanel\"><div class=\"examplePurposes pbold\"><div class=\"gwt-HTML\"><p>Example Purposes</p></div></div><div class=\"categoryDetailsList\"><div class=\"gwt-HTML\"><p>Provide secure log-in</p></div><div class=\"gwt-HTML\"><p>Remember how far you are through an order</p></div></div></div><span class=\"gwt-InlineHTML\"><br aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"spacing br-clear\"></span><table init=\"true\" class=\"gdprAccessibleTable optoutless\"><colgroup><col width=\"2%\"><col width=\"28%\"><col width=\"70%\"></colgroup><tbody></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"divider\"><hr></div><div class=\"categoryPanelAccessible\"><div class=\"catDivContainer\"><div class=\"categoryDivContent\"><div class=\"gwt-HTML accessibleCategoryHeadingName\"><h2 translate=\"no\">Functional</h2></div><div class=\"gwt-HTML\"><p>Functional cookies allow this website to remember the choices you make e.g., your username, log in details, language preferences and any customisations you make to website pages during your visit. They are used to provide features and services specific to individual users.</p></div></div><div class=\"truste-s